defrag for Debian
----------------------

Please note that defrag doesn't automatically work out what kind of
filesystem you're running it on - the `defrag' executable is for
Minix filesystems only. Please make sure that you use `e2defrag'
for ext2 filesystems.

I am not building the `edefrag' or `xdefrag' binaries as the kernel no
longer has support for the extended and xia filesystems. If anyone really
wants support for either or both of these filesystems then please let me
know and I will build it in.

 -- Timshel Knoll <timshel@debian.org>  Wed,  4 Jul 2001 21:00:10 +1000
